---
import DownloadButton from '@components/DownloadButton.astro';
---
<header>
    <h1>Rise and Fall:<br>Civilizations at War</h1>
    <p>The single entry point to the world of Rise & Fall. Official community hub: up-to-date knowledge base, global player rankings, and step-by-step guides.</p>
    
    <div class="hero-actions">
        <DownloadButton
            text="Download Launcher"
            thanksTitle="Thank you for downloading! ❤️"
            thanksDesc="Launcher download has started. See you on the battlefields of Rise and Fall!"
            thanksSkip="Skip"
        />
        <nav class="secondary-nav">
            <div class="tooltip-wrapper">
                <a href="https://github.com/kotop21/RiseAndFall" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
                <span class="tooltip-box">Website and launcher are 100% open source. Explore the code, contribute, and build with us!</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tooltip-wrapper">
                <a href="https://discord.gg/EKTAsxemqf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord</a>
                <span class="tooltip-box">The premier Rise & Fall community: 500+ players, matchmaking, tournaments, and 24/7 help!</span>
            </div>
            <div class="tooltip-wrapper">
                <a href="https://ko-fi.com/kotop21" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="donate-btn">Donate</a>
                <span class="tooltip-box">Runs on personal hardware & time. Thanks for supporting!</span>
            </div>
        </nav>
    </div>
</header>

<div>
    <section>
        <h2>🎮 How to start playing</h2>
        <div class="step-list">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Download launcher</strong> — click the <code>Download Launcher</code> button above and run it.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Choose installation option</strong> — on first launch, select <em>“Install New”</em> (or select an existing game folder) and choose your language (English / Russian).</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Automatic setup</strong> — the launcher automatically downloads the clean game, language pack, and essential mods (balance fix and ultra-fast lobby map transfer in fractions of a second).</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Launch game</strong> — click <code>Start Game</code> and join the battle!</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h2>🏆 Ranked games (1v1)</h2>
        <div class="alert" style="padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;">⚠️ <strong>Important:</strong> Match screen recording is strictly mandatory for both players to confirm victory.</div>
        <div class="step-list">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">01</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Join Discord</strong> — hop into our <a href="https://discord.gg/EKTAsxemqf" target="_blank" style="color: var(--accent); border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--accent);">community server</a>.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">02</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Registration</strong> — in bot chat type: <code>/register [your_nickname]</code>.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">03</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Challenge duel</strong> — find an opponent and challenge them: <code>/duel @nickname</code>.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">04</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Best of 3</strong> — play match series (first to win 2 rounds wins the match).</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">05</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Submit report</strong> — send the video recording via <code>/report</code>, and your rank in leaderboard updates automatically.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
<footer><hr /><p>Created by: xxds ❤️</p></footer>
